OL,3,AGrand Theft Auto 6 to get UK release
OL,4,Aafter 13-year wait for gamers around
OL,5,Athe world
OL,6,
OL,7,FGrand Theft Auto 6 is set to be
OL,8,Freleased in the UK at midnight, ending
OL,9,Fthe 13-year wait for a new instalment
OL,10,Fof the game
OL,12,FThe game has been gradually released at
OL,13,Fmidnight across different time zones -
OL,14,Fmeaning many people across the world
OL,15,Fhave already had the chance to play it
OL,17,FFrom 23:00 GMT, we'll be presenting
OL,18,Ffrom XP Tavern - a gaming lounge in
OL,19,FLondon - taking your live questions and
OL,20,Fanswering them with expert journalists,
OL,21,Fstreamers and gamers - you'll be able
OL,22,Fto watch live at the top of this page
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,318,300,200,140,0,100
